{"id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-boolexpr.md","title":"Boolean expression","display":"df-boolexpr — Boolean expression","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-boolexpr","aliases":["27-df-boolexpr"],"display":"df-boolexpr — Boolean expression","depends_on":["[[27-df-literal]]","[[27-df-constfunc]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.2 Definitions 1.4–1.5","source_printed_pages":"10–11","source_pdf_pages":"34–35","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-explicit-syntax-encoding"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-boolexpr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-boolexpr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolexpr — Boolean expression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 Definitions 1.4–1.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"10–11"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"34–35"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-explicit-syntax-encoding"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>；常函数与函数运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 是单射的有限元组编码；下面 0,…,4 是互异构造标签。表面叶子记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,\\ell\">\\(0,1,\\ell\\)</span> 分别省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline0,\\underline1,\\underline\\ell\">\\(\\underline0,\\underline1,\\underline\\ell\\)</span> 的下划线；连接记号在 Assertion 中给出带标签构造。</p>\n<p>求值的函数载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\underline b\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb B),\\quad\\underline\\ell\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle\\quad(\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n),\\quad\\neg E\\coloneqq\\langle2,E\\rangle,\\quad E\\wedge F\\coloneqq\\langle3,E,F\\rangle,\\quad E\\vee F\\coloneqq\\langle4,E,F\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\underline b\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb B),\\quad\\underline\\ell\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle\\quad(\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n),\\quad\\neg E\\coloneqq\\langle2,E\\rangle,\\quad E\\wedge F\\coloneqq\\langle3,E,F\\rangle,\\quad E\\vee F\\coloneqq\\langle4,E,F\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle\\mid\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle\\mid\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{r+1}\\coloneqq E_r\\cup\\{\\langle2,E\\rangle\\mid E\\in E_r\\}\\cup\\{\\langle3,E,F\\rangle,\\langle4,E,F\\rangle\\mid E,F\\in E_r\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}E_r.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{r+1}\\coloneqq E_r\\cup\\{\\langle2,E\\rangle\\mid E\\in E_r\\}\\cup\\{\\langle3,E,F\\rangle,\\langle4,E,F\\rangle\\mid E,F\\in E_r\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}E_r.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle0,0\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathbf0_n,\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle0,1\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_n,\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\ell.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle0,0\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathbf0_n,\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle0,1\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_n,\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\ell.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle2,E\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E),\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle3,E,F\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)\\wedge\\mathrm{Eval}_n(F),\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle4,E,F\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)\\vee\\mathrm{Eval}_n(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle2,E\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E),\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle3,E,F\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)\\wedge\\mathrm{Eval}_n(F),\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle4,E,F\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)\\vee\\mathrm{Eval}_n(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段并集给出最小有限语法树集合；标签互异且元组编码单射，因此每棵树唯一分解，结构递归唯一决定 Eval。负文字作为额外叶子是原书 ¬x 的保守语法糖。表达式树与其所代表函数分离；统一使用 Eval_n(E)(a)，不再使用未经定义的双参数 Eval_n(E,a)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-constfunc]]","e