BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline b\\coloneqq\\langle0,b\\rangle\\quad(b\\in\\mathbb B),\\quad\\underline\\ell\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle\\quad(\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n),\\quad\\neg E\\coloneqq\\langle2,E\\rangle,\\quad E\\wedge F\\coloneqq\\langle3,E,F\\rangle,\\quad E\\vee F\\coloneqq\\langle4,E,F\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"E_0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in\\mathbb B\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle\\mid\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E_{r+1}\\coloneqq E_r\\cup\\{\\langle2,E\\rangle\\mid E\\in E_r\\}\\cup\\{\\langle3,E,F\\rangle,\\langle4,E,F\\rangle\\mid E,F\\in E_r\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}E_r.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle0,0\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathbf0_n,\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle0,1\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_n,\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle1,\\ell\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\ell.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle2,E\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E),\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle3,E,F\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)\\wedge\\mathrm{Eval}_n(F),\\quad\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\langle4,E,F\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_n(E)\\vee\\mathrm{Eval}_n(F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n.","display":true}],"bytes":2620,"backlinks":[{"id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]、[[27-df-boolexpr]]。字串以 $[r]$ 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。$E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$；$\\iota$ 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限树语法。"},{"id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"文字在本目录表示为投影函数及其补；其作为表达式叶子的语法标签在 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 中另行构造。一致文字集不含互补对。坐标 $i$ 只在对应公式内量化，因而零元时仍定义文字载体与一致文字集；不会因要求选出 $i\\in[0]$ 而使整个定义不可实例化。"},{"id":"80321c8440894526","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$；$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]，$\\mathrm{occ}_i$ 见 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]。$m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\max\\emptyset=0$。下式定义 $\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)$ 与 $\\mathrm{read}(f)$。 $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$。"},{"id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$ 及其叶和构造标签取 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限语法树定义。叶子的表面记号为 $0,1,x_j,\\bar x_j$；出现次数按语法树计算。"},{"id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]，$\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。"},{"id":"6ea7333297b3209a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m\\geq1$、$n\\geq0$ 为整数；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$、$\\mathrm{Eval}_r:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_r$ 与带标签语法构造见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m$，$Y=(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m)\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$；$Y_{ij}$ 表示 $Y_i$ 的第 $j$ 个坐标。下式引入函数 $\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$，并引入后续方程使用的投影叶子 $X_i^{(r)}$ 和常元叶子 $C_b^{(r)}$；$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 沿用该语法的单射元组编码。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr|df-boolexpr — Boolean expression]]"},{"id":"1d6715331cf48592","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$、$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$r\\geq1$ 为整数。$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\models_n$、$X_i^{(r)}$ 及语法的 $\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]。$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$、$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$、$\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-thm-hornfunctional]]、[[27-thm-affinechar]]。有限语法析取由下节递归构造；$\\langle\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_s\\rangle$ 代表以 $[s]$ 为域的表达式序列，$\\langle\\tau_1\\rangle$ 是长度为1的序列。"},{"id":"5841c816fcbc1014","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{encExpr}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf{NPC}$ 见 [[27-df-npcomplete]]。"},{"id":"8937ff5c9726cd99","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]，$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。"},{"id":"083dcaa395f25a3d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$ and $\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (see [[27-df-boolexpr]])"}],"outgoing":["99c92f3457aacd12","35eab4f22873ea23","11de8465f2282555","5d10aed668d85817"]}